msgid "Off. Set CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_URL, CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_USER and CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_PASS (an app password from Nextcloud → Personal settings → Security) in wp-config.php."
msgstr "Aus. In der wp-config.php CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_URL, CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_USER und CLEAN_SHORT_LINKS_NEXTCLOUD_PASS setzen (ein App-Passwort aus Nextcloud → Persönliche Einstellungen → Sicherheit)."

